Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:33.74,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Initiating Deusura decoupling sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:04.49,Announcement,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency! Evacuate the palace at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.49,0:12:08.45,Announcement,,0,0,0,,I repeat... This is an emergency! Evacuate the palace at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.62,0:16:05.59,Announcement,,0,0,0,,After linking with the core ship,\NCompany 6 is to load the Deusura ll.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:44.31,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Full evacuation! Full evacuation!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:45.27,Announcement,,0,0,0,,633 engaged in orbit. Physical signal lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:39.41,Announcement,,0,0,0,,Begin routing surplus energy to the Desler Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack from Second Baleras complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.60,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.00,0:01:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just an idea... I used the Wave Motion Energy as a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.65,0:01:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato appears to have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Send observation data.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,After a long, hard journey, they died right before their goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.58,0:02:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the captain was like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to have met him, to give him a word of appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.84,0:02:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Yurisha seems unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.52,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's on the radar, near the point of impact... The Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,AA guns are badly damaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensors aren't working right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.69,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The planet's collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Epidra is no more...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A single attack, capable of destroying a planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing fluctuations in the gravitational gradient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.33,0:02:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This waveform is definitely that of the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We will continue, to the inner system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:03:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Wave Motion Gun has difficulty targeting objects at sub-light speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Without going deep into their range, we have no way to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead! Our destination is Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.58,0:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is approaching at sub-light speeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.23,0:03:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Talan from Second Baleras.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.91,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the attack damaged parts of our systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have repairs completed as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.21,0:03:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But targeting an object at sub-light speed, with the Desler cannon is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It will slow down in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Her Highness Starsha is on the hotline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She wishes to speak to you directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.43,0:03:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Lord Desler?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Using Wave Motion Energy as a weapon is sheer madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to complain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.32,0:03:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Complaints, complaints. Every time you come here, it's to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why do you not complain to the Terrons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.77,0:04:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship you brought here uses Wave Motion Energy as a weapon, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you saw that your little sister is doing well, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered her kept safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking, Abelt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Starsha...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.03,0:04:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. How unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this, Abelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:05:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ships at ten o'clock. Three carriers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy the Wave Motion Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.01,0:05:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.16,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Half speed... Launch the Hayabusas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The front carrier fleet will soon encounter the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the Melancas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.21,0:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them near the Yamato! Shoot them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard to starboard. We're heading straight for Garmillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.77,0:06:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage to the forward carrier fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is still descending.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the new capital is our only goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.69,0:06:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But nonetheless, we must make a show of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Imperial Capitol City of Baleras.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.00,0:07:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Make it through here, and you'll be at the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well... We will now strike at the enemy's heart, Lord Desler's palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've allowed the enemy onto our own soil?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the Imperial Guard doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.23,0:07:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimleh... He's useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Deploy the Wave Motion Shields!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to ram the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.60,0:08:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace for impact!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, equip weapons.\NAssemble a team and take command, Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is our lord safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Deusura?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.99,0:09:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}10... 9... 8...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}7... 6...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.74,0:09:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}5... 4... 3... 2... 1... 0...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.22,0:09:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's accelerating...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something has launched from the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.89,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki is aboard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No... You left me behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be... This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Second Baleras will be under our control shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.04,0:10:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall now begin the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar belk.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Minister Talan, the central control system is being taken over from outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The... The command is coming from the Deusura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our leader...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Talan, Industrial Sector 633 is entering decoupling sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.55,0:11:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go save Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll command the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.01,0:11:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.39,0:11:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something on radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Magnify!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A massive object in orbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.48,0:11:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Estimated mass, 60,000,000 tons.\NDescending from Lagrange point L1.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Estimated impact point is the palace. In other words, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.39,0:11:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It continues to descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.45,0:11:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The decoupling command came from Lord Desler!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From our lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It will reach point of impact at 2400 gek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How foolish...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.75,0:11:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, evacuate! Declare an emergency in the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.45,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying here is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.27,0:12:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this... Is this how a leader behaves, Desler?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Guidance beacon, locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Docking complete. Connected to Desler Cannon circuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister Talan is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, please tell me your intention!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you dropping Industrial Sector 633 on Baleras?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.91,0:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a rite of passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A rite of passage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Baleras and the Yamato will be annihilated together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.57,0:13:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And this noble sacrifice will give rise to the rebirth of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After the operation, Second Baleras will land on Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.96,0:13:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I hereby declare this orbital city fortress to be the new capital of Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A new center! A new Baleras!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.16,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And this Second Baleras will be a bridge between Iscandar and Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes until impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.94,0:13:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okita...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the Wave Motion Gun could destroy that much mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Through actions... Not words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:14:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time for everyone to do their best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What you must do... What only you can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going after Yuki—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.59,0:14:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.55,0:14:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.43,0:14:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, give me permission to launch in a Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai, you are relieved of your duties as Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.44,0:14:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You have another mission... To rescue Operations Officer Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.28,0:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I will allow you to take one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Susumu Kodai, will now go to rescue Operations Officer Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got this. In exchange...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Melda...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm simply protecting Lady Yurisha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,To us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do what only you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.11,0:15:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.76,0:15:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that resupply ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.09,0:16:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the control room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we escaping?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy was using the Wave Motion Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Yamato won't make it to Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.69,0:16:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal all emergency vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Releasing safety lock. Target is in range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.86,0:16:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Adjusting angle of inclination. Raising the bow slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix the hull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure in chamber rising. Energy charge at 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare shock and flash defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,4, 3, 2, 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato saved us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the Desler Cannon is back on line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.44,0:17:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's entering its firing sequence?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.78,0:18:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This will force the Wave Motion Core out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for everything. You needn't stay with me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've finally found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.09,0:18:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What only I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.23,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly, Zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even faster! Even higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Norran?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.62,0:18:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it pretty obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.95,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to be a real Garmillan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.62,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If my lord learns that I protected this secret weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.29,0:18:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,he may even make me a full Garmillan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.69,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And so... This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.02,0:19:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.27,0:19:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Norran!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.48,0:19:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Be well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Norran!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.50,0:19:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing hammer system activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.21,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus the energy so that it only strikes the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, stop! You're about to fire on your own people!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.55,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Desler Cannon firing sequence is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I must do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I must be the one to commit the sin,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,of sacrificing the noble Garmillan lives for the future of Great Garmillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall live with that sin forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.91,0:20:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning... Warning... Wave Motion Core has lost control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Energy has exceeded safety limits. Explosive compression imminent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.01,0:20:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,900)}I never did hear her real name...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.78,0:20:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Norran... You're a terrible liar...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,All ships behind us have been destroyed! Explosion is incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.37,0:20:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.83,0:20:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Is this how it all ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.84,0:21:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy fortress is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.23,0:21:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not dreaming, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.03,0:25:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Before them lies a blue planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.05,0:25:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A planet that will bring hope to their own home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.12,0:25:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But no people are to be found there, save for a lonely queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.92,0:25:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And her words come as a surprise. She says...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.30,0:25:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Distant Promised Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:26:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 199 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:49.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}This star is the only one
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:56.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}If you look for something so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.19,0:23:01.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It is not something you can see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.99,0:23:04.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You will find it inside anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.45,0:23:07.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Love is the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:14.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sorrow and strife
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.37,0:23:19.92,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}May cloud the blue sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:26.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The overlapping warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:32.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Becomes a light to illuminate the world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:38.44,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.44,0:23:42.07,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.07,0:23:45.03,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:46.86,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.86,0:23:50.70,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}But a dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:54.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.37,0:23:57.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:24:03.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}If you have nothing special
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.55,0:24:09.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Only the strength to yearn for it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.72,0:24:15.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Bound to the limits of time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.89,0:24:27.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,1000)}Create the trace of a miracle
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.00,0:24:42.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}A wish to the infinite universe
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:46.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}All is forgiven
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:49.63,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}And we all laugh together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:51.59,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Not a trick of the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.59,0:24:55.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}A dream from the bottom of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.35,0:24:58.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:01.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Walk on
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.52,0:25:05.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}No matter what tomorrow brings
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.15,0:25:07.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Together with you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.74,0:25:14.28,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}Forever
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:39.99,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1035)}{\blur7.5\shad0\fad(900,0)}Dimensional Mobile City Fortress Second Baleras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:29.29,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1200,840)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(2800,2000)}Episode 23
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:29.29,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1200,1073)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(2800,2000)}One Man's War
